{"D:\\wt\\ssimple4\\vlog\\ssimple4\\voz\\b005_t5.wav": {"text": "Every Sunday afternoon, after lunch, she sat at the low table with her good pen and wrote one letter by hand. To me, far away. To my brothers. To a cousin in the countryside. To her old teacher. To a neighbor who moved away. One letter every week for more than thirty years. She bought her stamps ten at a time. When people wrote back, she kept the letters in an old biscuit tin, and on rainy days she read them again. When the tin was full, she started a second tin and then a third. She said, the telephone is for news, but a letter is for feelings, and you cannot hold a telephone call in your hand when you miss somebody. Most people today send a quick message on the phone and forget it in one minute. A letter, she said, somebody keeps. I still have 140 of her letters. Everyone starts the same way, with the weather in Osaka. Write one letter this Sunday.", "words": [{"w": " Every", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " Sunday", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.74}, {"w": " afternoon,", "s": 0.74, "e": 1.6}, {"w": " after", "s": 1.6, "e": 2.0}, {"w": " lunch,", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.76}, {"w": " she", "s": 2.76, "e": 2.84}, {"w": " sat", "s": 2.84, "e": 3.12}, {"w": " at", "s": 3.12, "e": 3.32}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.32, "e": 3.46}, {"w": " low", "s": 3.46, "e": 3.68}, {"w": " table", "s": 3.68, "e": 4.04}, {"w": " with", "s": 4.04, "e": 4.34}, {"w": " her", "s": 4.34, "e": 4.46}, {"w": " good", "s": 4.46, "e": 4.78}, {"w": " pen", "s": 4.78, "e": 5.16}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.58}, {"w": " wrote", "s": 5.58, "e": 5.86}, {"w": " one", "s": 5.86, "e": 6.18}, {"w": " letter", "s": 6.18, "e": 6.5}, {"w": " by", "s": 6.5, "e": 6.78}, {"w": " hand.", "s": 6.78, "e": 7.44}, {"w": " To", "s": 7.82, "e": 7.86}, {"w": " me,", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.3}, {"w": " far", "s": 8.3, "e": 8.66}, {"w": " away.", "s": 8.66, "e": 8.96}, {"w": " To", "s": 8.96, "e": 9.56}, {"w": " my", "s": 9.56, "e": 9.72}, {"w": " brothers.", "s": 9.72, "e": 10.14}, {